<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-10-11T12:24:57.470Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 12:24:57 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The China Coast Guard has used water cannons to block Philippine Coast Guard vessels conducting medical evacuations at Ayungin Shoal, near Ren’ai Jiao, and in the Luzon Strait, and has also fired on a PCG ship during a medevac of a navy serviceman. Philippine forces have responded with joint operations involving the Coast Guard, Marine Corps and Navy to repel Chinese sampans and militia vessels in the territorial sea of Kota Island. China warned the Philippines to stop its alleged infringements after a PCG vessel transported an injured person from a grounded ship near Ren’ai. The incidents reflect an intensified gray‑zone strategy by China. There were 176 battle‑related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxOaXFxYXNELTRqeU1fUE45MW5uc2pXWGZ0dTRFWXJfRTlMRXBEUEk3X3RiVXJieVVBWG54b3VVOVVhRF9lWnNfS090VDAtbElUT3B3TmVjc0NjM3FaQWszUVk0cHZCNEJKYnpjZFVnZkwyRFMxUXlvZGoxVl9ock5YN2V4VzlSUy1CUjVUak5fV1lmT1pOcGRmcGU2MGE2WUhlLThkRmlwbkVsVWZINWc4WTZQTHhBRHdRRmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTE1pN0xjOFVPTWZPNXpIa3R0eHNpSnZCWm9rUVpEeWdBTkFvdFh1X1QySXVaZ3FvOW1TbWNxaENXdzJfd1RsX2NxWTl3QzE2WlBwRlk1QVYwZGh1dHpnbXhOR2UzSkY1aGxFWFllbURhbVlqbXNoa3lrMmEwc1FPQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;China Daily&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxNeVhmbUNJakVjMmE1NXhSQ19wc05LYmlOSHpWUHhQdTlEWTZaUkYtOXRqdWpRWFpYM3dNQzV4bHk5VjRZeXhHRm9yVEpGLTZHVFpxbFpHd2xmbjk4RjZJd0Z0VTM0QTVvV2xKa1Bfekc5ZzFXU1FXTlRobXpiTXh0SU5ZLVpkbi1TUWVhVkVBQmpuWk1ZYWI5VFVaRldwMkVvZDhB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Marine Insight&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYkFVX3lxTFAxTjJFS3pSaE9pQkwtTjU0c0lHMWo3MFo2OFV5UkFPY1d6SXplVkdDNXMwSF9QVHRPUzZkZGRsWmRSTUJhQmtfNkJub0RkbWN2UzdnZ2NQaHcxVUdtSnFYcGJR?oc=5&quo